OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated from homes in
OL,4,ABallymena security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated in a
OL,7,Fsecurity alert in Ballymena, County
OL,8,FAntrim.
OL,10,FPolice are at the scene in the
OL,11,FMoorfields Road area of the town.
OL,13,FTwo homes have been affected.
OL,15,FMembers of the public, including
OL,16,Fdrivers, are being advised to avoid the
OL,17,Farea.
